Error [jet.UnknownContextField]: `deadline` is a context field, so it can't be a context key
  --> tests/ui/context_key_reserved_name.jet:2:13
    |
  2 | #ContextKey deadline: 0
    |             ^^^^^^^^
 Why: `context.deadline` already names the context's own field
 Fix: Rename the key, e.g. `#ContextKey my_deadline: …`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0761
